## Local-dev tooling

```bash
# Regenerate this README from values.yaml + Chart.yaml :
make helm-docs

# Run the full PR #15 lint suite locally (mirrors CI Job 02-12) :
pre-commit run --all-files
helm lint charts/efe-stack/charts/efe-meta-swarm --strict
helm template tst charts/efe-stack/charts/efe-meta-swarm | \
    conftest test --policy policies/rego/efe --data policies/rego/efe/data -

# Run the helm-unittest assertions (93 across 11 suites) :
helm unittest charts/efe-stack/charts/efe-meta-swarm --strict
```

